# Admin-uploaded branding (agent profile pictures, deployment logos).
# Lives outside source control so a fresh `pnpm install` doesn't blow it away
# and uploaded customer assets aren't accidentally committed.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!avatars/
!branding/
!footer/
avatars/*
branding/*
footer/*
!avatars/.gitkeep
!branding/.gitkeep
!footer/.gitkeep
